editor.nod_help.page.troubleshooting=Kesalahan umum


editor.nod_help.chg.extra=<h2>Contoh chg</h2><p><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:chg"><code>chg</code></a> mengubah awal teks atau sebuah pola. Berguna untuk nomor telepon, kode, prefix, dan tabel penomoran ulang.</p><div class="notice"><b>Struktur:</b> kiri = yang dicari, kanan = bentuk baru. Gunakan tanda kutip untuk spasi, koma, atau karakter khusus.</div><details open><summary>Ganti prefix</summary><table><tr><th>Tujuan</th><th>Aturan</th><th>Contoh</th></tr><tr><td>Prefix</td><td><code>chg "01751","07051"</code></td><td><code>0175112345</code> -> <code>0705112345</code></td></tr><tr><td>Dash</td><td><code>chg "01751-","070-51"</code></td><td><code>01751-12345</code> -> <code>070-5112345</code></td></tr></table></details><details><summary>Pola dengan x</summary><p>NOD 2.0: <code>x</code> menangkap satu digit dan memasangnya kembali di kanan. Spasi dan strip di kiri hanya untuk keterbacaan.</p><pre>chg "0183x-xx xx","0183-x0 xx xx"</pre><p><code>01835-1234</code> -> <code>0183-501234</code>.</p></details><details><summary>Kesalahan umum</summary><ul><li>Letakkan aturan spesifik di atas aturan umum.</li><li>Jangan lupa koma.</li><li>Gunakan <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:trans"><code>trans</code></a> untuk terjemahan nilai lengkap.</li></ul></details>
editor.nod_help.math.extra=<h2>Math singkat</h2><p><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:math"><code>math</code></a> menghitung dengan <code>ans</code>. Pada baris pertama <code>ans</code> adalah nilai input; pada baris berikutnya <code>ans</code> adalah hasil sebelumnya.</p><div class="notice"><b>Struktur:</b> pilih dulu jenis perhitungan, lalu tulis syntax yang cocok. Untuk rumus besar, gunakan tanda kurung atau beberapa baris <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:math"><code>math</code></a>.</div><div class="math-flow"><span class="math-pill">1. Operasi dasar</span><span class="math-pill">2. Fungsi dan konstanta</span><span class="math-pill">3. Rumus kompleks</span><span class="math-pill">4. Kalkulus: diff, integral, limit</span></div><details open><summary>Operasi dasar</summary><table><tr><th>Tujuan</th><th>Syntax</th><th>Contoh</th></tr><tr><td>+</td><td><code>math ans + number</code></td><td><code>math ans + 32</code></td></tr><tr><td>-</td><td><code>math ans - number</code></td><td><code>math ans - 10</code></td></tr><tr><td>*</td><td><code>math ans * factor</code></td><td><code>math ans * 1.8</code></td></tr><tr><td>/</td><td><code>math ans / factor</code></td><td><code>math ans / 1.95583</code></td></tr></table><pre>Name Euro to cents&#13;&#10;input1 Euro&#13;&#10;input2 Cents&#13;&#10;format #.00&#13;&#10;math ans * 100&#13;&#10;end</pre></details><details><summary>Fungsi dan konstanta</summary><table><tr><th>Groep</th><th>Syntax</th><th>Catatan</th></tr><tr><td>Power</td><td><code>math ans^2</code> or <code>math pow(ans,3)</code></td><td>Square, cube.</td></tr><tr><td>Root</td><td><code>math sqrt(ans)</code></td><td>Can be used inside formulas.</td></tr><tr><td>Pi/e</td><td><code>math pi * ans^2</code><br><code>math e^ans</code></td><td>Circle and exponential.</td></tr><tr><td>Degrees</td><td><code>math sind(ans)</code><br><code>math cosd(ans)</code></td><td>Use <code>sin/cos/tan</code> for radians.</td></tr></table></details><details><summary>Rumus kompleks</summary><p>Gunakan tanda kurung jika urutan perhitungan penting. Perkalian selalu ditulis jelas dengan <code>*</code>.</p><pre>math sqrt(ans^2 + 25)&#13;&#10;math ((ans + 10) * 2) / 3&#13;&#10;math ans * (1 + 0.04)^5</pre><h3>Contoh: Pythagoras</h3><div class="mathml-formula"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="inline"><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow></math></div><pre>Name Hypotenuse&#13;&#10;input1 Side a&#13;&#10;input2 Side c&#13;&#10;format #.00&#13;&#10;math sqrt(ans^2 + 25)&#13;&#10;end</pre><p>Di sini <code>ans</code> adalah sisi <code>a</code>; sisi lain tetap <code>5</code>.</p></details><details><summary>Kalkulus: diff, integral, limit</summary><table><tr><th>Tujuan</th><th>Syntax</th><th>Hasil</th></tr><tr><td>Derivative</td><td><code>math diff ans^2</code></td><td>Kemiringan numerik.</td></tr><tr><td>Integral</td><td><code>math integral 0,1 ans^2</code></td><td>Luas numerik dari 0 sampai 1.</td></tr><tr><td>Limit</td><td><code>math limit 0 sin(ans)/ans</code></td><td>Perkiraan di sekitar 0.</td></tr></table></details><h2>Kesalahan umum</h2><ul><li>Jangan lupa <code>ans</code>.</li><li>Gunakan <code>sind</code> untuk derajat.</li><li>Gunakan <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:reverse"><code>reverse</code></a> untuk konversi balik yang rumit.</li></ul>
editor.nod_help.mode.extra=<h2>Kapan memakai mode?</h2><p><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:mode"><code>mode</code></a> menentukan jenis file NOD yang dibuat. Untuk converter biasa biasanya tidak diperlukan.</p><div class="notice"><b>Struktur:</b> gunakan <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:mode"><code>mode</code></a> hanya untuk jenis khusus, seperti pemrosesan data atau penyelesaian persamaan.</div><details open><summary>Modes</summary><table><tr><th>Mode</th><th>Kapan</th><th>Perintah</th></tr><tr><td><code>mode calculator</code></td><td>Converter biasa</td><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:math"><code>math</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:trans"><code>trans</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:chg"><code>chg</code></a></td></tr><tr><td><code>mode data</code></td><td>Pemrosesan data</td><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:table"><code>table</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:field"><code>field</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:output"><code>output</code></a></td></tr><tr><td><code>mode equation</code></td><td>Menyelesaikan persamaan</td><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:given"><code>given</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:equation"><code>equation</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:solve"><code>solve</code></a></td></tr></table></details><details><summary>Contoh: converter</summary><pre>Name Celsius to Fahrenheit&#13;&#10;input1 Celsius&#13;&#10;input2 Fahrenheit&#13;&#10;format #.00&#13;&#10;math ans * 1.8&#13;&#10;math ans + 32&#13;&#10;end</pre></details><details><summary>Contoh: equation</summary><pre>Name Solve equation&#13;&#10;mode equation&#13;&#10;given y = 20&#13;&#10;equation y = x * 2&#13;&#10;solve x&#13;&#10;constraint x >= 0&#13;&#10;end</pre></details>
editor.nod_help.trans.extra=<h2>Contoh trans</h2><p><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:trans"><code>trans</code></a> menerjemahkan satu nilai lengkap. Pakai untuk kata, kode tetap, status, postcode, dan daftar pendek.</p><div class="notice"><b>Struktur:</b> <code>trans "old value","new value"</code>. Input lengkap harus cocok dengan nilai di kiri.</div><details open><summary>Terjemahkan teks persis</summary><table><tr><th>Tujuan</th><th>Aturan</th><th>Hasil</th></tr><tr><td>Word</td><td><code>trans "hallo","hello"</code></td><td><code>hallo</code> -> <code>hello</code></td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td><code>trans "open","in progress"</code></td><td><code>open</code> -> <code>in progress</code></td></tr><tr><td>Address</td><td><code>trans "2566 GB 241","Nieboerweg 241, 2566 GB Den Haag"</code></td><td>postcode + house number -> address</td></tr></table></details><details><summary>trans / chg</summary><table><tr><th>Perintah</th><th>Kapan</th><th>Contoh</th></tr><tr><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:trans"><code>trans</code></a></td><td>Input lengkap diketahui persis.</td><td><code>hallo</code> -> <code>hello</code></td></tr><tr><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:chg"><code>chg</code></a></td><td>Hanya awal atau pola yang berubah.</td><td><code>01751-xxxxx</code> -> <code>070-51xxxxx</code></td></tr></table></details><details><summary>Kesalahan umum</summary><ul><li>Kiri adalah input, kanan adalah output.</li><li>Gunakan <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:chg"><code>chg</code></a> untuk perubahan sebagian.</li><li>Hindari terjemahan ganda untuk input yang sama.</li></ul></details>
editor.nod_help.full.classic=<h2>Pengenalan editor NOD</h2><p>Editor NOD adalah tempat kerja untuk converter. Kode ditulis di atas, input/output dites di bawah, dan preview di kanan menampilkan label, simbol, teks pengantar, dan hasil.</p><h2>Klasik 1.73 dan NOD 2.0</h2><table><tr><th>Syscalculator 1.73 / NOD 1.0</th><th>Syscalculator 2.0 / editor NOD</th></tr><tr><td>File teks klasik dengan <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:name"><code>Name</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:input1"><code>input1</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:input2"><code>input2</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:math"><code>math</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:trans"><code>trans</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:chg"><code>chg</code></a>, dan <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:end"><code>end</code></a>.</td><td>Dasar yang sama tetap berjalan untuk file NOD lama.</td></tr><tr><td>Posisi simbol sering harus diingat lalu dites.</td><td>Preview langsung menunjukkan <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:symb1"><code>Symb1</code></a> sampai <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:symb4"><code>Symb4</code></a>.</td></tr><tr><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:chg"><code>chg</code></a> terutama mengganti prefix.</td><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:chg"><code>chg</code></a> lama tetap kompatibel; NOD 2.0 menambah pola dengan capture <code>x</code>.</td></tr><tr><td>Bantuan banyak bergantung pada contoh.</td><td>Editor punya saran, bantuan klik kanan, dan halaman contoh.</td></tr></table><h2>Syntax: ringkasan lengkap NOD 1.0 dan NOD 2.0</h2><p>Tabel ini menunjukkan syntax dari NOD klasik dan tambahan di NOD 2.0.</p><table class="syntax-compare"><tr><th>Syntax / feature</th><th>NOD 1.0</th><th>NOD 2.0</th><th>Note</th></tr><tr><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:name"><code>Name</code></a></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Converter name/title.</td></tr><tr><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:urln"><code>URLN</code></a></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Reference/source line remains supported.</td></tr><tr><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:input1"><code>input1</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:input2"><code>input2</code></a></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Labels for input and output.</td></tr><tr><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:result"><code>Result</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:resfou"><code>Resfou</code></a></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Result label and error text.</td></tr><tr><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:symb1"><code>Symb1</code></a> through <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:symb4"><code>Symb4</code></a></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Symbols left/right of input and output; NOD 2.0 shows them in preview.</td></tr><tr><td><code>format #.00</code></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Number formatting stays the same.</td></tr><tr><td><code>mode calculator</code></td><td><span class="no">×</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>NOD 2.0 uses <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:mode"><code>mode</code></a> for special file types; normal converters also work without mode.</td></tr><tr><td><code>mode data</code></td><td><span class="no">×</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>For table/field processing.</td></tr><tr><td><code>mode equation</code></td><td><span class="no">×</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>For solving equations with <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:given"><code>given</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:equation"><code>equation</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:solve"><code>solve</code></a>.</td></tr><tr><td><code>math ans * 1.8</code></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Classic calculation with <code>ans</code>.</td></tr><tr><td><code>math sqrt(ans^2 + 25)</code></td><td><span class="no">×</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Richer formulas and functions in NOD 2.0.</td></tr><tr><td><code>chg "01751-","070-51"</code></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Classic prefix replacement keeps working.</td></tr><tr><td><code>chg "0183x-xx xx","0183-x0 xx xx"</code></td><td><span class="no">×</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>New in NOD 2.0: pattern with <code>x</code> capture.</td></tr><tr><td><code>trans "old","new"</code></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Exact text translation remains compatible.</td></tr><tr><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:reverse"><code>reverse</code></a></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Reverse direction of a converter.</td></tr><tr><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:table"><code>table</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:field"><code>field</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:output"><code>output</code></a></td><td><span class="no">×</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>NOD 2.0 data converters with fields and output construction.</td></tr><tr><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:phoneformat"><code>phoneformat</code></a></td><td><span class="no">×</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Format phone numbers in data/number converters.</td></tr><tr><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:lookup"><code>lookup</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:match"><code>match</code></a></td><td><span class="no">×</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Look up tables or connect values.</td></tr><tr><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:given"><code>given</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:equation"><code>equation</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:solve"><code>solve</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:constraint"><code>constraint</code></a></td><td><span class="no">×</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Solve equations with constraints.</td></tr><tr><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:preview"><code>preview</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:backup"><code>backup</code></a></td><td><span class="no">×</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Editor/safety information for NOD 2.0 files.</td></tr><tr><td><code>indoprint ... indoend</code></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Introduction text remains supported.</td></tr><tr><td><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:end"><code>end</code></a></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>Closes the NOD file.</td></tr><tr><td>Live preview, suggestions, right-click help</td><td><span class="no">×</span></td><td><span class="yes">✓</span></td><td>This is editor help, not old runtime syntax.</td></tr></table><h2>Yang tetap sama</h2><ul><li>Command tetap per baris dan mudah dibaca.</li><li><a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:end"><code>end</code></a> menutup file.</li><li>Converter sederhana tetap singkat.</li></ul><h2>Yang baru</h2><ul><li>Live preview dan simulator.</li><li>Graph Preview untuk grafik converter math.</li><li>Saran saat mengetik.</li><li>Bantuan lebih lengkap per command.</li><li>Lebih banyak contoh untuk <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:math"><code>math</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:trans"><code>trans</code></a>, <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:chg"><code>chg</code></a>, simbol, dan <a class="cmd-link" href="nodpage:cmd:indoprint"><code>indoprint</code></a>.</li></ul>
